oherence and cohesion for the context.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Passive of Modals", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "The passive voice is commonly used in English. We use the passive when the 'doer' (agent) of the action it not so important. We are not interested in knowing who did the action. Our attention is on the object. Here's some more information about the passive of modal verbs. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ol type=\"a\"><li> Future form: subject + will + be + past participle<br/><span class=\"italic\">A new image <span class=\"underline\">will be</span> created.</span><br/><span class=\"italic\">A positive impact <span class=\"underline\">will be</span> our main goal.</span> <br/><span class=\"italic\">A sense of social responsibility <span class=\"underline\">will be</span> emphasized. </span></li><li>Modals: can / could + be + past participle <br />We use these forms to talk about present and past possibility.<br/><span class=\"italic\">Honestly, not much <span class=\"underline\">can be</span> said right now.</span></li><li>Modals: must / should / might + be + past participle</li></ol>", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Present Perfect", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the Present Perfect tense to talk about a past action or an action that began in the past that is connected to the present in some way.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use the <span class=\"underline\">Present Perfect tense</span> to talk about experience. <br/>This is how you form the Present Perfect: subject + have + past participle ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "When you use the Present Perfect tense, you think about the past and present together. There is some connection between what happened in the past and now.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "We've decided that many things had to be changed.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We've experienced a lot of growth over the years.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "We have identified areas that need to be worked on. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "Q&A", "type": "name"}, {"content": "question and answer; an informational session", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I am inviting Mr. Giorgio Farmani for a Q&A with the press.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob07aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use when doing a Q&A.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "top priority", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something that is very important and must be completed immediately", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Top priority will be given to those who signed up in advance.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob07aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "in light of", "type": "name"}, {"content": "because of", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: In light of the scandal and issues, we've decided that certain things must be changed.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob07aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "venture", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a new project or activity", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We've agreed to contribute to educational and social programs in our new venture.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn8le14ob07aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "revenue", "type": "name"}, {"content": "money that a company receives from sales", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "