xperienced growth in our revenue and customer base. We have attracted attention and we've even won a wide range of awards. But none of that matters. Attention should be given to our community. A sense of responsibility towards those who help us will be emphasized. We've agreed to contribute to educational and social programs in our new venture. That's our purpose.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Reporter</span>: How do you want people \u00ad consumers and the industry \u00ad to feel when they see your new brand?"}, {"time": "67000", "image": "engenn8le14ob07re2img07.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: Not much can be said about this right now. However, we have identified parts of our brand that have failed to connect to our target market. A system will be established to support  what our brand promises. The cake must taste as good as it looks!\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Reporter</span>: One last question, what's the idea behind incorporating social responsibility?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Farmani</span>: This shouldn't be answered now, but all I can say is that encouraging a positive impact on our community will be our top priority."}]}}], "_data": [], "id": 1, "type": "audio"}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}